From: richard-rhino <richard-rhino@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 16:51:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Spec decode: structured output

With speculative decoding, constrain each batch before its own sampler
instead of sampling all batches combined, which skipped rejection sampling
and failed for lack of sampling metadata. The scheduler sends a block of
num_speculative_tokens + 1 grammar masks per request, also for requests
with fewer drafts.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Signed-off-by: richard-rhino <richard-rhino@users.noreply.github.com>
